   <dc:title>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">London, UK, March 11th 2023: A nurses NHS protest placard left against a hospital building. Reads "End the NHS Crisis" Support the strikes, fund our NHS, Privatisation kills. Copy space. </rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:title>
